    "before": {
      "attributes": {
        "id": "j53",
        "title": "T17:  only the bubbly look changed.  With the look off, a Spell drawing's `<` `>` share the punctuation colour with every operator (CodeRules), and an HTML file is plain, so darkening them there would darken every operator too.  The tiny end-tag foot (`⟨|⟩` in its small pill) keeps its own ink.",
        "status": "open",
        "state": "open",
